<overview>
<p>The Armed Forces of the Federated Suns integrate conventional infantry directly into their Regimental Combat Teams, assigning foot, mechanized, and jump platoons to work permanently alongside BattleMech and armored formations. Towing Sniper cannon, a direct-fire variant of the standard Sniper artillery piece, these platoons engage targets with heavy-caliber shells that can breach reinforced positions.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Intro date based on production date of AFFS 3067+ advanced infantry kit.  Federated Long Rifle is the classic long arm of the AFFS.
</notes>

